  <div class="container-narrow">
  {{ sectionHeader('FAQ', 'Frequently Asked <span class="text-brandOrange">Questions</span>', '', {max: ''}) }}
  <div class="reveal">
  {% call faqItem("What is the MOQ for OEM/ODM orders?", true) %}Our MOQ starts at 500 units per SKU for ODM on in-stock models, 1,000-2,000 units for ODM new development, and 3,000+ units for OEM with new tooling. We offer flexible MOQ options for startup brands, contact us to discuss your requirements.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Can I request samples before bulk ordering?", true) %}Yes. Standard samples are available within 3-7 days. Sample fees are typically refundable upon placement of a bulk order. We encourage sample testing to verify quality and compatibility.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What certifications do your products carry?", true) %}All products are engineered to meet global standards including CE, FCC, RoHS, and Qi/Qi2. Power banks are UN38.3 certified. We also assist clients in obtaining UL, PSE, KC, and other market-specific certifications.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What is the typical lead time?") %}In-stock ODM orders ship in 25–35 days after sample approval. ODM development projects take 35–50 days in production, and OEM orders take 30–60 days. Rush production is available in 15–20 days for established partners.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Are you a factory or a trading company?") %}We are a direct factory — an ISO 9001-certified OEM/ODM manufacturer in Shenzhen with our own production lines, R&D team and 4-stage QC. You work factory-direct, with no trading-company markup.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("What product categories do you manufacture?") %}Four categories: power banks (including semi-solid-state), Qi2/Qi2.2 wireless chargers, GaN V fast chargers (20W–240W) and car chargers. Each category offers stock ODM models and full OEM tooling.{% endcall %}
  {% call faqItem("Do you offer logo, packaging and CMF customization?") %}Yes. Full OEM/ODM customization: custom logo (printing, laser, UV), Pantone CMF, retail packaging, multilingual manuals and FNSKU/FBA-ready packaging. MOQ starts at 500 units for logo-only customization.{% endcall %}
  </div>
 </div>
 </section>

